                                                                             <div aria-label="NCC campus building wall" class="section-medium-image" style="background-image: url('_images/section-bkgds/1920x1080_section-dark.jpg')">
        <div class="ncc-numbers-content-dark">
                            <div class="section-header-dark text-align-center">
                    <h2>NCC By The Numbers</h2>
                </div>
                                        <p>At NCC, we have strength in numbers. Our statistics prove our value without any fluff because our students deserve a college they can count on.</p>
                    </div>
        <div class="container ncc-numbers-3-col">
            <div class="row">
                                                                                           <div class="ncc-numbers-box-dark col-lg-4 col-xl-4">
                                                    <h3>94%</h3>
                                                                            <p>of NCC graduates are either in a career or continuing their education.</p>
                                                                            <a class="ncc-numbers-link-dark" href="education-and-training/programs/index.html">Find Your Program</a>
                                            </div>
                                                                                           <div class="ncc-numbers-box-dark col-lg-4 col-xl-4">
                                                    <h3>$40K</h3>
                                                                            <p>up to $40,000 in savings compared to area colleges and universities.</p>
                                                                            <a class="ncc-numbers-link-dark" href="cost-and-financial-aid/tuition-and-fees/index.html">View Costs</a>
                                            </div>
                                                                                           <div class="ncc-numbers-box-dark col-lg-4 col-xl-4" style="border-right: none; border-bottom: none;">
                                                    <h3>$53M</h3>
                                                                            <p>available in financial aid and scholarship money.</p>
                                                                            <a class="ncc-numbers-link-dark" href="cost-and-financial-aid/index.html">View Financial Aid</a>
                                            </div>
